OL,3,GNEWSAReform councillor hits back in
OL,4,ARNLI migrant row
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Reform UK councillor has said he has
OL,7,Freceived "extreme abuse" after an MP
OL,8,Fcriticised his stance on the RNLI's
OL,9,Frole in rescuing migrants.
OL,11,FRNLI volunteers faced online abuse,
OL,12,Fwhile Portsmouth's lifeboat station has
OL,13,Fbeen closed, after a protest on 6
OL,14,FSeptember at Eastney following a
OL,15,FChannel small boat crossing.
OL,17,FSouthampton Itchen Labour MP Darren
OL,18,FPaffey accused Reform's Hampshire
OL,19,Fleader George Madgwick of lobbying
OL,20,Fagainst the RNLI and described his
OL,21,Fstance as "incomprehensible".
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,334,330,200,160,0,100
