OL,3,GNEWSAReform councillor hits back in
OL,4,ARNLI migrant row
OL,5,
OL,6,FMadgwick said RNLI members "should
OL,7,Fnever be personally attacked" but he
OL,8,Fdid not "politically or morally agree"
OL,9,Fwith the charity's role in picking up
OL,10,Fmigrants. He said he had since been
OL,11,F"assigned security".
